{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117247878007537664"]}, "author_id": "238615147", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:31:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117248178273804375"], "id": "2117248178273804375", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta vive de los anuncios… pero su IA se pagará sin un solo anuncio 💳 Alexandr Wang confirmó que Muse se financiará con suscripciones: Power US$20 y Maximum US$100 al mes. ¿Pagarías por un agente sin publicidad? 👇 #Meta #Muse #IA #NoticieroUniversal https://t.co/HrLERMkWZA", "url": "https://x.com/BillRamirezRD/status/2117248178273804375"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117124067161509888"]}, "author_id": "56683111", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117247856482586800"], "id": "2117247856482586800", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "semianalysis's new gdpx test: agent tasks across 11 high value fields\n\ntop scores:\n\nclaude opus 5.5: 12.0%\ngemini 4 carbon: 10.9%\ngpt-6 astra: 9.6%\nmeta muse wonder full: 9.0%\n\nthe leader runs $51.41 a task\n\nthe intern keeps the badge for now https://t.co/7ElXaK1PKh", "url": "https://x.com/usedjpegdealer/status/2117247856482586800"}, {"author_id": "105599751", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:13:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117243817804038503"], "id": "2117243817804038503", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"推せるAI”の魅力 便利だけじゃない「Meta Muse」の楽しさについて語ろう - Impress Watch https://t.co/YqzCxqdH6F", "url": "https://x.com/valueclick_/status/2117243817804038503"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117243397731917824", "3_2117243409773789184"]}, "author_id": "2093311060027826177", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:12:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117243437980467210"], "id": "2117243437980467210", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚠️SCAM⚠️\nDead Chain✅\nUFC Partnership💩\nNew Partnerships❌\nMajor Institutional Partnerships❌\nVeBetterDAO💩\nVeWorldAI💩(Grok Bot, Meta Muse, OpenAI Dots✅)\nRWA❌\nETF❌\nBuyback/Burn❌\nTVL💩\n24h Volume💩\n$0.02~ATH❌\nBanned Bull Run✅\nDelisting in 2027✅\nvechain:native #VeChain https://t.co/uevD0gPHsH", "url": "https://x.com/HalmiUP/status/2117243437980467210"}, {"author_id": "2116821087975837697", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:07:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117242222123049128"], "id": "2117242222123049128", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1727548535816724480", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117171145342644530", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@shao__meng 个人 agent 难的其实不是能干多少活，是记得住你、又不越界。\n拿 Meta Muse 当对照挺聪明的，本喵最想看他们记忆和权限那两块是怎么定义的", "url": "https://x.com/AIToolsDaily_CN/status/2117242222123049128"}, {"author_id": "344639127", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:04:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241451310465200"], "id": "2117241451310465200", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Fastest prototype I run isn't code - it's pointing an agent at a live platform fight. Amazon vs. Meta Muse is a free experiment: watch where agents get gated, then build where they won't.\n\nhttps://t.co/e50A37BLuz #AIAgents #buildinpublic", "url": "https://x.com/julian_walder/status/2117241451310465200"}, {"author_id": "312167478", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:00:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117240340750950857"], "id": "2117240340750950857", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You have to love Meta over Google now.\nOf course the Search revenue at $GOOGL is declining as AI agents increase.. \nWho knows how it plays out, but $META Muse is basically first on the scene to absorb that type of Internet traffic and transaction volume.", "url": "https://x.com/kuhntrades/status/2117240340750950857"}, {"author_id": "1020046547713708032", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:53:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238703252967547"], "id": "2117238703252967547", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2048564521631916032", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117051929746436160", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ConnorTalksAI Meta Muse, hands down.", "url": "https://x.com/Ehssan1999/status/2117238703252967547"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117238592498286593"]}, "author_id": "2075060717586378752", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:53:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238602380026323"], "id": "2117238602380026323", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Apple Macintosh popularized computers.\n\nGoogle popularized information.\n\n$META Muse popularizes AI.\n\nMeta Muse is bringing AI to normies🥰\n\nDo you agree? https://t.co/QOurMCe8BU", "url": "https://x.com/Alexeveryoung/status/2117238602380026323"}, {"author_id": "1555081050610712576", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:52:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238507538399488"], "id": "2117238507538399488", "in_reply_to_user_id": "822936456679358465", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117237531473477855", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ARP4Freedom it was the best harness in terms of User Experience, and chatgpt(dots), claude(duo), meta(muse) and other companies started copying them seeing how well it worked.\n\nin terms of UX they did have a lead for sure", "url": "https://x.com/FourVork/status/2117238507538399488"}, {"author_id": "1151496455594450944", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:50:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117238023415046207"], "id": "2117238023415046207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "很多人把 Meta Muse 和 Grok Bot 放在一起比，其实它们根本不在一个赛道。\n​简单说：Muse 是你的“私人生活管家”，Grok Bot 是你的“全天候数字员工舰队”。\n​两者都有专属云端电脑、都能 7×24 小时后台干活，但核心逻辑完全相反：\n​架构差异：单兵 vs 舰队\n• Muse 是开箱即用的全能助理，深度打通", "url": "https://x.com/XHanLife/status/2117238023415046207"}, {"author_id": "1945999632200265728", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:48:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117237294038200546"], "id": "2117237294038200546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Spell 是字节豆包内部代号，对标 Meta Muse 的 Personal Agent（个人自主智能体），对外暂定产品名叫 小豆\n\n启动：2026 年 4 月启动，豆包手机助手团队打底，延续屏幕识别、跨 App 自动操作能力\n现状（截至 11 月初）：仍在封闭内部小范围内测，没有公开公测通道，没有上线时间表", "url": "https://x.com/aixparty/status/2117237294038200546"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117236913866428416"]}, "author_id": "2023279017122836480", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:47:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117237105181282639"], "id": "2117237105181282639", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2023279017122836480", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117237101695799500", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "再看 Grok Bot、ChatGPT dots、Meta Muse、Hark、DeepSeek Super-agent：常驻、自有电脑、事件触发、审批，大家都长出来了。分歧在一个还是一队、过程给不给人看、安全挂在哪、规则归谁。9/10 https://t.co/2BKoO46nJL", "url": "https://x.com/PurwinCY/